{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44550","headline":"诗三百三首 二四七 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二四七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨到云霞观，忽见仙尊士。\n星冠月帔横，尽云居山水。\n余问神仙术，云道若爲比。\n谓言灵无上，妙药心神秘。\n守死待鹤来，皆道乘鱼去。\n余乃返穷之，推寻勿道理。\n但看箭射空，须臾还坠地。\n饶你得仙人，恰似守屍鬼。\n心月自精明，万象何能比。\n欲知仙丹术，身内元神是。\n莫学黄巾公，握愚自守拟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}